OL,3,GNEWSANurseries face "difficult balance"
OL,4,A- minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe politician with responsibility for
OL,7,Fnursery provision in Jersey has said
OL,8,Fshe wants to "open lines of
OL,9,Fcommunication" with the sector to
OL,10,Faddress challenges including staffing
OL,11,Flevels.
OL,13,FThe Assistant Minister for Education,
OL,14,FDeputy Lucy Stephenson said she was due
OL,15,Fto meet those who had expressed
OL,16,Fconcerns.
OL,18,FIt comes ahead of the permanent closure
OL,19,Fof the Busy Bees Leeward nursery in St
OL,20,FHelier at the end of this week.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
