OL,3,GNEWSANurseries face "difficult balance"
OL,4,A- minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Jersey Early Years Association
OL,7,F(JEYA) has previously warned that
OL,8,FJersey does not have enough
OL,9,F"appropriately qualified staff" to meet
OL,10,Fincreasing demand.
